68
00:02:12,292 --> 00:02:13,009
Under the hood,

69
00:02:13,079 --> 00:02:15,382
Tachyon plays what providers really send:

70
00:02:15,591 --> 00:02:16,296
HLS,

71
00:02:16,644 --> 00:02:17,477
MPEG-TS,

72
00:02:17,639 --> 00:02:18,148
DASH,

73
00:02:18,334 --> 00:02:20,197
RTSP and multicast;

74
00:02:20,463 --> 00:02:20,798
H.264,

75
00:02:20,718 --> 00:02:24,861
HEVC and 4K ten-bit video;

76
00:02:25,128 --> 00:02:25,717
AAC,

77
00:02:25,799 --> 00:02:27,338
Dolby and DTS sound.

78
00:02:28,041 --> 00:02:29,765
Hardware decoding comes first,

79
00:02:29,788 --> 00:02:31,177
