82
00:02:37,772 --> 00:02:39,554
Buffering adapts to your connection.

83
00:02:40,361 --> 00:02:41,402
On live channels,

84
00:02:41,507 --> 00:02:44,331
every hiccup grows the safety cushion then it gently

85
00:02:44,227 --> 00:02:45,488
