88
00:02:50,616 --> 00:02:53,463
And Tachyon only ever opens one stream per service,

89
00:02:53,602 --> 00:02:56,067
so it never eats up your plan's connections.

90
00:02:56,778 --> 00:02:59,428
Every remote key and touch gesture is mapped and

91
